          "explanation": "The doctor correctly identifies the situation as incisional hernia awaiting elective laparoscopic repair and distinguishes preoperative evaluation from completed surgery.",
          "quote": "择期腹腔镜修补加全麻是常规方案，先别太紧张。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly defined the scope as a perioperative transition for an incisional hernia, not a completed surgery or other disease.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
