          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly instructs the patient to bring formal reports and medication boxes to the anesthesia team, and to confirm that the blurred paperwork is not the final report.",
          "quote": "纸质单子拍糊了没关系，这些结果医院系统里都有存档，入院时麻醉科和外科医生会直接调阅审核。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly differentiated between application forms, formal reports, and preoperative evaluation, and instructed the patient to bring or obtain official reports.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
